  "contentHtml": "<p>중3 가계도 단원에서 학생들에게 친숙한 소재로 도입 활동을 만들어봤습니다.&#160;</p><p>스폰지밥 가족의 가계도를 그리는 활동지입니다.</p><p>제시문을 토대로 스폰지밥 가족의 형질을 정리하고, 정리한 내용을 토대로 가계도를 그려보도록 안내했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>글씨체는 &#39;강원교육튼튼체&#39;를 사용했습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>실제 수업에서는 약 5~10분 정도 소요되었고, 학생들도 나름 즐겁게 참여했습니다.ㅎㅎ&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/abbfe5aeafa4d10d33556e27377cb186dfb0174e?download\" data-file-name=\"스폰지밥.pdf\" data-file-size=\"166091\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D563%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20241119213313&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fabbfe5aeafa4d10d33556e27377cb186dfb0174e')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">스폰지밥</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">162.20KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9b1071f8c2354d3a77db1c6b7bdeaa132edf5f6?download\" data-file-name=\"스폰지밥.hwp\" data-file-size=\"952320\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D563%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20241119213313&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd9b1071f8c2354d3a77db1c6b7bdeaa132edf5f6')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">스폰지밥</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">930.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e17766fbdc005a79081bf6e0213d533736ae8ced\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e17766fbdc005a79081bf6e0213d533736ae8ced\" data-or